!! Proposed Definitions And Examples

;__sei__ (SEI): discursive bridi -- start discursive (metalinguistic) bridi --


;__ti'o__ (SEI): mex precedence -- mathematical expression (mex) operator precedence (discursive) --


;__se'u__ (SEhU): Terminator for SEI and SOI. 


;__to__ (TO): start parenthesis -- left parenthesis; start of parenthetical note which must be grammatical Lojban text --


;__to'i__ (TO): editorial unquote -- open editorial unquote (within a quote); contains grammatical text; mark with editorial insert --


;__toi__ (TOI): Terminator for TO. (end parenthesis / right parenthesis)



